This series of work consists of exercises with ways to unconventionally engage with architectural space. I experimented extensively with the technique of triangulation to convey a sense of dynamism as in futurist art\'92s geometric forms. To enhance the dialogue between surfaces, I incorporated \'93window openings,\'94 reminiscent of Lina Bo Bardi\'92s Pompeia with its \'93Spanish Civil War holes.\'94 This also accentuates the triangular form, where edges engage spatially and conceptually, allowing for dynamic interaction within the composition.}